------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. BiRefNet workflow (hand-written)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

spikes/comfy-measure/workflows/birefnet_rmbg.json is a hand-written API workflow for the
ComfyUI_BiRefNet_ll custom nodes (https://github.com/lldacing/ComfyUI_BiRefNet_ll,
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 lldacing). It names the nodes and the BiRefNet
`General.safetensors` model; per that project's LICENSE, the code and models of BiRefNet
are released under the MIT License. No node code or model weights are included here.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. AI-generated test images
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

spikes/comfy-measure/inputs/harbor_1024.jpg and the sheets under
spikes/comfy-measure/results/samples/ are AI-generated test images. They were made locally
with ComfyUI from the stock Z-Image Turbo template prompt (section 1), using
Z-Image-Turbo (Apache-2.0), the Z-Image-Turbo Fun ControlNet Union 2.1 lite (Apache-2.0),
SAM 3.1 (SAM License), BiRefNet (MIT), the TAEF1 preview decoder (MIT) and the LoRA
`pixel_art_style_lora_z_image_turbo` (Apache-2.0). No model weights are included in this repository; docs/spikes/
08-comfy-measurements.md lists the sources. The images show no real person.

